<title>UK: Royal Bank Scotland in $200 mln ADR issue.</title>
<headline>Royal Bank Scotland in $200 mln ADR issue.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Royal Bank of Scotland Group Plc said on Tuesday it planned to issue eight million dollar preference shares, to be represented by American Depositary Shares, in the U.S. at $25 per share.</p>
<p>The bank said in a statement the issue would raise $200 million. The proceeds would be used to strengthen its capital base and for &quot;general corporate purposes&quot;.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
